      "detail": "relies_on names context-only profile field(s): prior_deviation_flags; POL-GEN-01 permits profile context but not a ground of decision",
      "reason_code": "PROFILE_FIELD_AS_GROUND",
      "side": "DRIVER"
    }
  ]
